      "message": "This chain is largely taken from hardware/xiaomi implementation.\n\nDue to the non-existence of Android.mk under hardware/lineage, this has to be built via Blueprint, thus the following configurations are missed:\n- TARGET_POWERHAL_MODE_EXT\n- TARGET_TAP_TO_WAKE_NODE\n\nIt\u0027s probably possible to expose these via Soong configs, but I\u0027m not smart enough for this.\n\nFor the same reason as above, users will need to import `hardware/lineage/interfaces/power-libperfmgr` directly so as to avoid build failures on devices that don\u0027t have PRODUCT_SOONG_NAMESPACES for the needed namespaces.",
